        <p>SELLING CLASS.--1, S Andrews. NOVICE CLASS.---Nonvich, clear ticked, evenly marked : 1,2, 3 and vhc, J Dodson,— •</p>
        <p>EXECUTION OF THE MANCHESTEE MURDERER Fred. Ballington (41), butcher, was hanged at Strangewa3s Gaol, Manchester, on Tuesday, for the murder of his wire in a railway carriage at London-road Station, Manchester, on May 25th. Ballington was perfectly collected, and met his death with much calm- ness, EIDELWEISS VICTIMS. 'three fatal accidents occurred in the Alps on Monday to tourists looking for eidelweiss. The victims were Herr Neumsyr. a glasQ painter, of lifunich, who fell over a precipice in Jocheralm ; Herr Hoffmann, a painter, who was killed in the Zielthal ; and Herr Falger, who met his death in the Vennathal,</p>
