        <p>BAPTIST CRURCIL COLBORNE STREET, TO-MORROW, SUNDAY, AUGUST 2ND. PREACRRR : Rev. R. E. LBTLISFLRN. Mositrusa 1.45. A Psalm of Heart's Rise." EVENTN4 6.30. " The upper roam." Visitors welcome. All seats free. Wednesday 3 p.m. Open-air Meeting at Bridge Foot. Chapel if wet.</p>
